# =============================================================================
# ikiastrro research diagram — PLANETARY STATES / AVASTHA coverage
# The five classical Parashari avastha systems, their classical inputs mapped
# to existing stored facts, their output states, and build status.
# Status as of 2026-08-31.  Render:  d2 planetary-avasthas.d2 planetary-avasthas.svg
# =============================================================================
direction: right

classes: {
  ready:    { style: { fill: "#1b5e20"; font-color: "#ffffff"; stroke: "#2e7d32" } }   # all inputs present
  partial:  { style: { fill: "#e65100"; font-color: "#ffffff"; stroke: "#ef6c00" } }   # inputs mostly present
  blocked:  { style: { fill: "#b71c1c"; font-color: "#ffffff"; stroke: "#c62828" } }   # needs new input / source
  data:     { style: { fill: "#0d47a1"; font-color: "#ffffff"; stroke: "#1565c0"; stroke-dash: 3 } }
}

status: STATUS {
  near: top-left
  x: |md
    - **No avastha is computed or stored today.** `grep -ri avastha src/` = only a doc-comment.
    - `jyotishganit/components/states.py` is an empty stub; the vendored PyJHora copy has no avastha module either.
    - Source for the formulae: **BPHS** (public-domain Parashara verses) + **B.V. Raman, *Graha and Bhava Balas*** (not in repo — cited-edition discipline, like the descriptive nakshatra fields).
  |
}

inputs: Existing stored facts (tbl_Chart_KeyDetails + tbl_Chart_Conjunctions) {
  deg:    "DegreesInSignDecimal  (D1 only)";                         deg.class: data
  odd:    "Sign  -> odd/even (sign index)";                          odd.class: data
  dignity:"DignityStatus  (Exalted..Debilitated, 9-level)";          dignity.class: data
  combust:"IsCombust + DistanceFromSunDegrees";                      combust.class: data
  aspb:   "AspectingPlanets  +  tbl_Chart_Aspects";                  aspb.class: data
  conj:   "tbl_Chart_Conjunctions  (Planet1, Planet2, Sign, House)"; conj.class: data
  house:  "HouseNumberFromLagna  (5th-house rule)";                  house.class: data
  lon:    "NirayanaLongitudeDegrees  +  NakshatraId";                lon.class: data
  bmap:   "natural benefic/malefic list  (derivable, not stored)";   bmap.class: data
  bday:   "tbl_BirthDetails time  ->  janma ghatis  (NOT persisted per-chart)"; bday.class: data
  pnum:   "planet-number map  (new constant)";                       pnum.class: data
}

systems: Avastha systems {

  baaladi: |md
    ## 1. Baaladi (infancy)  —  🟢 INPUTS READY
    5 states from degree-in-sign:
    Baala 0-6 / Kumara 6-12 / Yuva 12-18 / Vriddha 18-24 / Mrita 24-30
    (reversed in even signs). Effect fraction per state.
    **Pure one-line function.** D1 only (degree is D1-only).
  | { class: ready }

  jagradadi: |md
    ## 2. Jagradadi (waking)  —  🟢 INPUTS READY
    3 states from dignity:
    Jagrat (own / exalted) / Swapna (friend / neutral) / Sushupti (enemy / debilitated).
    **Pure map from DignityStatus.** Works for D1 and every varga.
  | { class: ready }

  deeptadi: |md
    ## 3. Deeptadi (mood)  —  🟠 MOSTLY READY
    9 states, precedence-ordered:
    Deepta(exalted) / Swastha(own) / Mudita(friend) / Shanta(benefic sign) /
    Deena(enemy) / Vikala(combust) / Peedita(hemmed by malefics) /
    Khala(debilitated / with malefic) / Garvita(moolatrikona).
    Needs a **natural benefic/malefic classifier** over conj+aspect planets. Textual variants -> pin a source.
  | { class: partial }

  lajjitadi: |md
    ## 4. Lajjitadi (dignity/shame)  —  🟠 MOSTLY READY
    6 states:
    Lajjita (5th house + with Rahu/Ketu/Sun/Mars/Saturn) /
    Garvita (exalted / moolatrikona) /
    Kshudhita (enemy sign / with an enemy / with Saturn) /
    Trishita (watery sign, malefic aspect, no benefic aspect) /
    Mudita (friend sign / with a benefic / with Jupiter) /
    Kshobhita (with Sun + malefic + no benefic aspect).
    All ingredients stored; needs the same benefic/malefic + node classification layer.
  | { class: partial }

  lajjita_rel: |md
    ## 4b. "Lajjitadi relationships"  —  🟠 RAW FACTS STORED
    The planet-to-planet associations the 6 Lajjitadi states key off
    (conjunct Jupiter -> Mudita, conjunct Saturn -> Kshudhita, conjunct Sun -> Kshobhita, ...).
    - **Stored:** tbl_Chart_Conjunctions (per chart type) + AspectingPlanets
    - **Missing:** the classification (benefic / malefic / node / luminary) and the Lajjitadi mapping
  | { class: partial }

  sayanadi: |md
    ## 5. Sayanadi (posture) — [FUTURE]  —  🔴 BLOCKED
    12 states (Sayana..Nidra) from a birth-time + nakshatra + lagna + planet-number formula,
    plus a Cheshta/Drishti sub-state (partly from speed — now stored: SpeedLongitudeDegPerDay).
    Needs: **janma ghatis persisted**, a planet-number map, and a **cited edition** (high textual variance).
  | { class: blocked }
}

# ---- wiring inputs -> systems --------------------------------------------
inputs.deg -> systems.baaladi
inputs.odd -> systems.baaladi
inputs.dignity -> systems.jagradadi
inputs.dignity -> systems.deeptadi
inputs.combust -> systems.deeptadi
inputs.aspb -> systems.deeptadi
inputs.bmap -> systems.deeptadi
inputs.house -> systems.lajjitadi
inputs.dignity -> systems.lajjitadi
inputs.conj -> systems.lajjitadi
inputs.aspb -> systems.lajjitadi
inputs.bmap -> systems.lajjitadi
inputs.conj -> systems.lajjita_rel
inputs.aspb -> systems.lajjita_rel
inputs.lon -> systems.sayanadi
inputs.bday -> systems.sayanadi: "needs persisting"
inputs.pnum -> systems.sayanadi: "new constant"

# ---- proposed storage --------------------------------------------------
store: Proposed: tbl_Chart_PlanetAvastha (one row per planet, D1) {
  cols: |md
    ChartResultId, BirthDetailId, ChartType, Planet,
    BaaladiState + BaaladiEffectFraction,
    JagradadiState,
    DeeptadiState,
    LajjitadiStates (multi),
    SayanadiState  (nullable, future),
    ComputedAt
  |
}
systems.baaladi -> store
systems.jagradadi -> store
systems.deeptadi -> store
systems.lajjitadi -> store
systems.sayanadi -> store: "later"
